# Flowmark exclusions.
#
# POLICY: format the whole repository. Exclude only files we have a specific,
# tested reason to leave raw. Each exclusion below states that reason.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated agent skill files.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# These skill directories hold files carrying explicit DO-NOT-EDIT markers,
# regenerated byte-deterministically by their own tools (`tbd setup --auto`,
# `flowmark --install-skill`, `pprose install`, `softschema skill --install`).
# Formatting them would both diverge them from their generators and be silently
# overwritten on the next regeneration. The pprose skills bundle generated
# reference files beside their SKILL.md, so the whole directory is excluded.
#
# Exclusion is per generated skill, NOT per skill directory: hand-written skills
# live alongside these and are formatted like all our other prose. Adding a
# generated skill means adding two lines here; adding a hand-written one means
# adding none.
